      "import.bam": "ObjC spawns samtools via NSTask (~111ms) while Java uses in-process htsjdk (~0.7ms) and Python pysam (~4.6ms) \u2014 different mechanisms, not comparable. Currently below-floor (min 0.7ms) so already suppressed; allow-listed so it stays explained if a larger BAM lifts the fastest SDK above the 5ms floor.",
      "signatures.pqc.sign": "Java BouncyCastle pure-Java ML-DSA (~2.5ms) vs liboqs C in Python/ObjC (<0.2ms) \u2014 different crypto backends. Below-floor today; allow-listed for when the workload grows past the floor.",
      "signatures.pqc.verify": "Java BouncyCastle pure-Java ML-DSA (~0.8ms) vs liboqs C in Python/ObjC (<0.15ms) \u2014 different crypto backends. Below-floor today; allow-listed for when the workload grows past the floor."
    },
